<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Roosevelt returns three months after starting maintenance-and-reliever therapy. Since the four-week review he has had no night waking and daytime symptoms about once a week. He uses one as-needed inhalation before training and rarely any other. He has not missed an evening dose since setting a reminder. The bedding covers are in place. His home peak flow has settled between 590 and 610 L/min, so 610 is his personal best. He is back to full boxing, rowing, and a long hill walk most weekends. No exacerbations, urgent visits, or oral corticosteroids. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>No night waking; symptoms about once a week</td></tr><tr><td>Reliever use</td><td>One inhalation before training; rarely otherwise</td></tr><tr><td>Adherence</td><td>All maintenance doses taken since setting a reminder</td></tr><tr><td>Home peak flow</td><td>590 to 610 L/min; personal best 610</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Full training</td></tr><tr><td>Exacerbations</td><td>None since starting controller therapy</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
